{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "370e2a7b-c061-88bc-8820-75879b31a487",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T10:27:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, and happy Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Sandra. Yes, um, my name is Dario Pina. I am calling about a noise problem. Music, from a bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help you with that. Which bar is it, and where are you located?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 2 Carroll Avenue. The bar is not next to me, you understand. It is some blocks away. But the music, I can hear it very clear in my kitchen. Even blocks away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Blocks away, wow. Is that every night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, almost every night. It has been going on for about one week now. Starting maybe nine, nine thirty, and it goes late. The bass, mostly. [pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is it a band, or a DJ, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think a band, sometimes. And, one moment please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. My phone, it made a very high squeal, the feedback. I put it down on the speaker of the radio. Now I move it. Is better?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Much better, yes, I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:25:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Então, so, my question. Should I call the police, the non-emergency line, instead of you? I do not want to call the wrong office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a fair question. For music that's going late at night, the police non-emergency line is the quickest, because they can send someone while it's happening. I can still take down your complaint here so it's on record with the city, especially since it's been a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, I would like that. For the record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So that's 2 Carroll Avenue, music from a bar a few blocks away, about a week, evenings into late night. Do you know the name of the bar?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am not certain of the name. I know the street where it is, I can tell you that. Maybe I can find the name and call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. And a callback number, in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0184. I'll pass this along to the right people."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:53-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Sandra. That is all I need. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T10:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Pina. Bye now."
    }
  ],
